**Preview data**

Use the preview results button to verify the sample values of the selected properties and query filter.

### Sync

The refresh interval determines how often your data is synced between the data source and the Aha! Microsoft Graph connector index. There are two types of refresh intervals - full crawl and incremental crawl. For more details, see [refresh settings](configure-connector.md#guidelines-for-sync-settings).

You can change the default values of the refresh interval from here if you want to.
